{
  "comment": "Existing-script UPDATE envelope for opalreader-api-v2 (Part 2 replacement upload). DERIVED from the pinned creation metadata by tools/derive-update-envelope.mjs: the creation migration is removed (no migration is applied; replaying new_sqlite_classes on the deployed class would fail), and the dashboard-set secret is carried as an inherit binding. The value of OPALREADER_ACCESS_TOKEN never appears here. Execution is governed by the replacement-upload plan; this file authorizes nothing.",
